{"about_the_game":"Meet our little friend Sputnik. Help its journey to become the greatest star in the solar system - the Sun!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Gameplay With Cosmic Gravity</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730270/extras/189a3b72c3fbfbb552331b635d55675e.poster.avif?t=1766768224\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730270/extras/189a3b72c3fbfbb552331b635d55675e.webm?t=1766768224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730270/extras/189a3b72c3fbfbb552331b635d55675e.mp4?t=1766768224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Cosmic gravity is applied to the planet, which makes it different from the classic Suika-style game.<br>The ability to target the other side of the planets adds much more strategy and depth to the game!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Merge Planets</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730270/extras/991dcaab478674b1fef19bca003cfc08.avif?t=1766768224\" width=616 height=300 /></span><br>Match two identical planets to create bigger celestial bodies.<br>Discover 10 dazzling planets, each with its own place in the solar system!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730270/extras/e88b82d59e6eecc7394546b598876b2a.avif?t=1766768224\" width=616 height=168 /></span><br>Watch out for the bubble! If the planet pops out of the bubble, it's game over.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Adorable Planets</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730270/extras/ca4223ed03271b1d910e9aa7d9cf6f72.avif?t=1766768224\" width=616 height=168 /></span>